<title>CHINA: Peregrine issues call warrants on red chip basket.</title>
<headline>Peregrine issues call warrants on red chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Friday it issued 61 million American-style call warrants on a basket of red chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Merchants Hai Hong Holdings Co Ltd 0.15 shares</p>
<p> China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd	   0.15 shares</p>
<p> China Resources Enterprises Ltd	    0.10 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$4.2390    PREMIUM	20.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.81	GEARING	1.26x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   24.APR.98    BOARD LOT    50,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$10.2125   SETTLEMENT   14.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG    LISTING DATE 16.JUL.97</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
